d=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,s,J\\in V\">\\(r,s,J\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceDomain}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceDomain}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c63f9745812e31bd\" href=\"?note=c63f9745812e31bd\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-domain.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-domain.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RestrictionMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{RestrictionMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b538e18ed5bdb1c5\" href=\"?note=b538e18ed5bdb1c5\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-restriction-map.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-restriction-map.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqRestrictionSequence}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqRestrictionSequence}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}restriction\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSeqRestrictionSequence}_S(r,s,J)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists D\\;\\exists R\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceDomain}_S(D,s)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,D,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{31mm}{}\\land J\\subseteq D\n\\land\\mathrm{RestrictionMap}_S(r,s,J,D,R)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}restriction\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSeqRestrictionSequence}_S(r,s,J)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists D\\;\\exists R\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceDomain}_S(D,s)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,D,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{31mm}{}\\land J\\subseteq D\n\\land\\mathrm{RestrictionMap}_S(r,s,J,D,R)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The domain of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> is required to be an ordinal, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> is its graph restriction to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-function-restriction.md","status":"resolved","id":"cfb4df0f853ccdd7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-function-restriction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-restriction-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"b538e18ed5bdb1c5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-restriction-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-domain.md","status":"resolved","id":"c63f9745812e31bd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-seq-sequen